{"product_id":"travel-with-kids","title":"Travel with kids","description":"\u003cp\u003eFamily holidays are precious, hard-earned, and over all too quickly, so it's important for parents to get them right. Travel with Kids is the first guidebook to provide a wide-ranging overview of the choices available. Visually striking, and inspiring and practical enough to serve as an effective holiday planner, the book fills a hole in the market. The large, full-color format is irresistible for browsing, planning and dreaming up the ultimate family holiday wish-list. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:24 x 210  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: William Gray \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781906098032 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 384\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43663353938073,"sku":"15RD-4-9781906098032","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/bd44a1eb26e039d9d30062350baa4a48.jpg?v=1702462035","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/travel-with-kids","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}